@startuml
skinparam defaultFontName Helvetica
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam rectangleBorderColor #4A6FA5
skinparam rectangleBackgroundColor #F7F9FC
left to right direction
title From inputs to confirmed state
rectangle "inputs +\nprevious state" as IN
rectangle "requested\nintent" as REQ
rectangle "arbitration\n+ constraints" as ARB
rectangle "safe / effective\nintent" as SAFE
rectangle "applied\n(output renderer)" as APP
rectangle "confirmed\n(feedback)" as CONF
IN --> REQ : output <- expr
REQ --> ARB
ARB --> SAFE : Bool constraints only\nturn true -> false
SAFE --> APP : device\napplication
APP --> CONF : encoder, limit switch,\nvision, ...
note bottom of SAFE
Each stage has its own provenance
and quality. Evidence at one stage
does not prove the next stage.
end note
@enduml
